<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Inverter repair starts with finding the fault, not swapping parts. A qualified technician reads the error code, tests the battery bank, checks the DC side, the AC load and the earthing, then tells you whether the problem sits in the inverter, the batteries, the panels or the original installation. This site is advertising for independent Nigerian solar technicians and repairs nothing itself, so this page shows you what a proper job looks like before you let anyone touch your system.</p><p>The usual complaints are an inverter that beeps and trips when the AC comes on, tubular batteries that no longer last the night, panels that seem to give less after harmattan, and a system that was badly installed and keeps cutting out. Call now and describe yours, with the inverter model, the battery type and how old everything is. Any repair price has to come from the technician's written quote, because no published inverter repair charge was found for Nigeria.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Fault diagnosis before any quote</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A technician reads the inverter's error code and display, then tests battery voltage, charge current and the connected load before naming a part or a price.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Battery health testing</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">When batteries no longer last the night, age and battery type are checked first. Lead-acid batteries last only three to five years, according to BusinessDay in February 2026.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Overload and tripping checks</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A 5 kVA inverter at 0.8 power factor carries about 4 kW of real load (our arithmetic from the kVA to kW relationship). The technician compares your AC, pumping machine and other loads against the kW figure on the datasheet.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Panel cleaning after harmattan</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Dust on panels cuts the light reaching the cells. A maintenance visit covers cleaning, connector and mount checks, and a look at the panel cables.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Putting right bad installations</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Loose terminals, undersized cables, missing breakers or surge protection, poor earthing and badly ventilated batteries should be found and corrected, or the job redone properly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Findings and quote in writing</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You should get the fault found, the exact parts by model, the warranty on the repair and the VAT treatment on paper before work begins.</p>
      </div>
</div>
